automatically if fully remedied within 30 days after You first learn of
it. This exception does not cover clause 4's publication citation duty or
permit excluded company use. Other restoration requires written
authorisation from the relevant Licensors; excluded use requires clause 7.
Restoration does not retrospectively authorise a breach or release claims
unless the relevant rights holder expressly agrees.

Compliant recipients' permissions and independent rights under clause 6
survive. Ownership, independent-rights provisions, warranty and liability
terms, and rights concerning earlier breaches survive termination.

